  "post_content": "<p>(87 fotos) Els barris de Sant Joaquim i el Tossalet d&#39;Onda han coincidit aquest dimarts en organitzar vaques i bous, aix&iacute; como dos embolades.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/EmboladaSantJoaquim.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 290px;\" /></p>\n<p>A Sant Joaquim eren animals de la ramaderia &#39;El Mijares&#39;,</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/IMG_4846.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>mentre que els del Tossalet eren de Miguel Parejo.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santxoxim17bousdimarts/img_3306.jpg\" alt=\"img_3306\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santxoxim17bousdimarts/img_3309.jpg\" alt=\"img_3309\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santxoxim17bousdimarts/img_3311.jpg\" alt=\"img_3311\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santxoxim17bousdimarts/img_3316.jpg\" alt=\"img_3316\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santxoxim17bousdimarts/img_3317.jpg\" alt=\"img_3317\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santxoxim17bousdimarts/img_3319.jpg\" alt=\"img_3319\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santxoxim17bousdimarts/img_3321.jpg\" alt=\"img_3321\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santxoxim17bousdimarts/img_3322.jpg\" alt=\"img_3322\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a